hexo-theme-syutoi is derived from hexo-theme-shoka,
originally created by Ruri Shimotsuki (霜月琉璃).

The original MIT copyright and license are preserved in LICENSE.

The optional image viewer bundles PhotoSwipe 5.4.4 by Dmitry Semenov,
licensed under MIT. Its copyright and license are distributed in
source/js/photoswipe.LICENSE.txt. PhotoSwipe is loaded only when enabled
and an eligible body image is opened.

Optional local search uses Pagefind 1.5.2 (MIT). Its license is distributed
in source/js/pagefind.LICENSE.txt. Pagefind builds search resources locally;
its browser engine loads only after a query on the enabled search page.
